<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
	<title>Uh-oh! Something doesn't look right.</title>
	<style>
		body,
		h1,
		p,
		ul {
			margin: 0;
			padding: 0;
		}

		@font-face {
			font-family: 'ProximaNova';
			font-weight: 400;
			font-style: normal;
			font-display: swap;
			unicode-range: U+0000-00FF, U+0131, U+0152-0153, U+02BB-02BC, U+02C6, U+02DA, U+02DC, U+2000-206F, U+2074, U+20AC, U+2122, U+2191, U+2193, U+2212, U+2215, U+FEFF, U+FFFD;
			src: url(https://asset.zcache.com/assets/graphics/z4/fonts/ProximaNova-Reg.woff2) format('woff2');
		}

		@font-face {
			font-family: 'ProximaNova';
			font-weight: 700;
			font-style: normal;
			font-display: swap;
			unicode-range: U+0000-00FF, U+0131, U+0152-0153, U+02BB-02BC, U+02C6, U+02DA, U+02DC, U+2000-206F, U+2074, U+20AC, U+2122, U+2191, U+2193, U+2212, U+2215, U+FEFF, U+FFFD;
			src: url(https://asset.zcache.com/assets/graphics/z4/fonts/ProximaNova-Bold.woff2) format('woff2');
		}

		:root {
			--font-size: 16px;
		}

		/* General Body and Layout Styling */
		body {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			align-items: center;
			justify-content: center;
			min-height: 100vh;
			color: #222222;
			font-family: 'ProximaNova', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
			font-size: var(--font-size);
			text-align: center;
			background-color: #f3f5f6;
		}

		.container {
			display: flex;
			gap: 24px;
			flex-direction: column;
			align-items: center;
			max-width: 535px;
			margin: 16px auto;
			padding: 40px;
			background-color: #fff;
			border-radius: 12px;
			box-shadow: 0 4px 8px 0 rgba(64, 64, 64, .25);
		}

		.logo {
			width: 150px;
			aspect-ratio: 3.5;
			object-fit: cover;
		}

		.robot {
			width: 100px;
			aspect-ratio: 425/728;
			margin-top: -16px;
		}

		h1 {
			color: #a81a0c;
			/* Alerting red color */
			font-size: 32px;
			font-weight: 700;
			line-height: 36px;
		}

		p {
			line-height: 28px;
		}

		/* List Styling (Quick Fixes) */
		ul {
			align-self: flex-start;
			padding-left: 1.5em;
			text-align: left;
		}

		/* New custom styling for list items to use the deep blue color */
		li:not(:last-child) {
			margin-bottom: 8px;
		}

		/* Error Code Styling */
		.error-code {
			display: inline-block;
			padding: 6px 10px;
			color: #333;
			font-family: monospace;
			font-size: 14px;
			font-weight: bold;
			background-color: #e4e4e4;
			border-radius: 4px;
		}

		/* Button/Link Styling */
		.report-button {
			display: inline-block;
			margin-top: -8px;
			padding: 15px 30px;
			/* Primary blue for the button */
			color: white;
			font-size: 16px;
			text-decoration: none;
			background-color: #1f239c;
			border-radius: 1000px;
			transition: background-color .2s ease-in-out, box-shadow .2s ease-in-out;
		}

		.report-button:hover {
			background-color: #020567;
			box-shadow: 0 4px 8px 0 rgba(2, 5, 103, 0.25);
		}

		@media (max-width: 767px) {
			:root {
				--font-size: 16px;
			}

			.container {
				gap: 16px;
				margin: 0;
				padding: 24px;
			}
		}
	</style>
</head>

<body>
	<main class="container">
		<img alt="Zazzle logo" class="logo" src="https://asset.zcache.com/assets/graphics/blocked/zazzle.png">

		<img alt="Robot pretending to be a person in a trench coat" class="robot"
			src="https://asset.zcache.com/assets/graphics/blocked/robot.png">

		<h1>Uh-oh! Something doesn't look right.</h1>

		<p>
			Oops! Are you Human or a Robot in Disguise?
		</p>

		<p>
			It looks like there's a little confusion! We've hit pause just to make sure everything's A-OK.
		</p>

		<p>
			If you're real (like we hope you are), try these quick steps:
		</p>

		<ul>
			<li>Refresh the page in a moment.</li>
			<li>Disable any VPNs you might be using.</li>
			<li>Clear your browser cookies and give it another go.</li>
		</ul>

		<p>
			Still having trouble? Get back to creating your magic! Let us know what's happening and include this unique
			error code:
		</p>

		<div class="error-code">f8932399b5a945c3a53e000000000001</div>

		<a class="report-button"
			href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeduYznRH1ACpwF7R0UFDvS-5egmq_jS6snIPJPfMXiSSoKgQ/viewform?usp=pp_url&entry.1250776704=f8932399b5a945c3a53e000000000001"
			target="_blank">
			Submit a Report
		</a>
	</main>
</body>
</html>
